library/std/compression/deflate.sn:
// RFC 1951 DEFLATE codec. Decoding accepts stored, fixed-Huffman, and
// dynamic-Huffman blocks. Encoding uses fixed Huffman codes with a bounded
// 32 KiB LZ77 hash-chain search so it performs real compression without
// requiring a dynamic-tree optimizer.

